{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:56 2026-11-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:56 2026-11-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:56 2026-11-20 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d993f32f8c37245bbece5b69b27e1c54/2026-11/555_11.jpg\"/><p>今（20日）晨8時許，一名姓周（40歲）女子昏迷在港島南區淺水灣一號泳灘上，救生員聞訊趕到，發現她尚有呼吸脈搏，帶往救護站急救，未幾救護車趕至，轉送醫院搶救。據了解，女事主曾服用大量藥物，不排除仰藥自殺。據了解，周女患產後抑鬱症，去年離婚，獨居深水埗區。</p><img alt=\"女事主倒卧灘頭。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84168f6efcf0812fc21ec6e9a2b8e542/2026-11/01_1_34.jpg\"/><img alt=\"多名救生員在場急救。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afce44672bfa25aa935819c07d8f1652/2026-11/02_39.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警方到場調查。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13dc0a82ed6b2bda55b264d4473603e4/2026-11/03_1_31.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警方到場調查。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/347a1fe4a1510064ec01458f6be01d1f/2026-11/04_3_21.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場在淺水灣一號泳灘。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7399fb2ec4b35c65c65be1b2ea72bf59/2026-11/05_1_20.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場在淺水灣一號泳灘。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/133cef09fc279b2632940f625eb68b53/2026-11/06_3_8.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場在淺水灣一號泳灘。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50290769903f48c20b64de34c090fcc8/2026-11/07_3_9.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:02.171480+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:56:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:57:38.106880+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:34.991135+00:00","content_hash":"8ae9c3cda9ddd5fa9307781f03b97b56165b50c1f615588f6b56fa629ee316d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}